              "o4"
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Related Voyager milestone",
            "value": "On November 18, 2026, NASA’s Voyager 1 reached one light-day from Earth—about 16.1 billion miles (25.9 billion kilometers). Voyager 1 launched in 1977 and is managed by NASA’s Jet Propulsion Laboratory.",
